# Title: Azure Network Firewall Policy Modified or Deleted
# ID: 83c17918-746e-4bd9-920b-8e098bf88c23
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Austin Songer @austinsonger
# Date: 2021-09-02
# Tags: attack.impact, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1686.001
# Description: Identifies when a Firewall Policy is Modified or Deleted.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((operationName equals "MICROSOFT.NETWORK/FIREWALLPOLICIES/WRITE" OR operationName equals "MICROSOFT.NETWORK/FIREWALLPOLICIES/JOIN/ACTION" OR operationName equals "MICROSOFT.NETWORK/FIREWALLPOLICIES/CERTIFICATES/ACTION" OR operationName equals "MICROSOFT.NETWORK/FIREWALLPOLICIES/DELETE"))
